@prefix cbh: <https://example.org/cbh#> .
@prefix sh:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Value membrane for the CBH demo contract (closed world — what may cross into the clean
# holon). Same posture as stem-shapes.ttl: the contract author declares per-field
# verification strength. `port`/`commodity` are verified by SCHEME membership (declared
# on the field itself, in cbh-contract.ttl); `volume` gets a pattern here so the trio is
# a complete, self-contained illustrative example.
cbh:ReceivalRecordShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass cbh:ReceivalRecord ;
    sh:property [ sh:path cbh:volume ;
        sh:pattern "^[0-9]{1,3}(,[0-9]{3})*$" ] .
